{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Track an application"},"description":"Adds a school to the authenticated user's SchoolScope application tracker, or changes the status or note of a school already on it. A new entry takes the school's door and how-to-apply line from SchoolScope's record and starts at \"planning\" (\"Planning to apply\") unless a status is given. It changes the user's saved list. Statuses, in order: planning (\"Planning to apply\"), applied (\"Applied\"), confirmed (\"Confirmation checked\"), waiting (\"Waiting for the lottery or letter\"), offer (\"Offered a seat\"), waitlisted (\"Waitlisted\"), accepted (\"Accepted\"), declined (\"Declined\"). A list holds at most 30 schools. Requires the `applications:write` OAuth scope.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"note":{"description":"The family's note on this school, up to 500 characters; it replaces any earlier note, and an empty string clears it.","maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"slug":{"description":"The school's slug: the last segment of its schoolscope.co/ca/school/<slug> address, e.g. 'lowell-high-3407'.","maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]+$","type":"string"},"status":{"description":"Where the family stands with this school.","enum":["planning","applied","confirmed","waiting","offer","waitlisted","accepted","declined"],"type":"string"}},"required":["slug"],"type":"object"},"name":"track_application","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"application":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"added":{"type":"string"},"closed":{"type":"boolean"},"door":{"type":"string"},"how":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"nextDate":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"date":{"type":"string"},"label":{"type":"string"},"note":{"typ